                <p>
                    Solve the trigonometric equations by hand, and then use a calculator to 
                    approximate the solutions.
                </p>
            </introduction>
            <task>
                <statement>
                    <p>
                        <m>1 - 3 \sin(\chi) = 0</m> on the interval <m>\left[0,2\pi\right]</m>.
                    </p>
                </statement>
            </task>
            <task>
